    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bovey prides itself on small‑town values, guided growth, and preserving its historical, cultural, and natural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.boveymn.gov/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Located in Itasca County, Bovey is part of Minnesota’s Iron Range, a region known for its rich mining history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bovey%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2011, a project began to drain portions of Bovey’s lake to prevent overflow and protect low‑lying town areas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bovey%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In June 2011, Bovey’s lake water level reached 1316.1 feet above sea level, higher than many low‑lying parts of town.",
